<Input>
<Text-field style="Text" layout="Normal" spaceabove="10">Next, recall that for appropriately sized zero-one matrices, the Boolean product <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> is the matrix whose <Equation executable="false" style="2D Math" input-equation="" display=""></Equation> entry is obtained by the formula </Text-field>
</Input>
</Group></Presentation-Block><Presentation-Block>
